Who Can Participate?
Schools can participate by nominating their best project(s) selected through an intra-school competition.Nominations must be submitted by the authorized school representative using the school’s official email ID.

Send nominations to shardinnovationchallenge@gmail.com.

Nominations submitted through students’ personal email IDs or any non-official email IDs will not be accepted.

